16^{17} &= (10+6)^{17} \equiv 6^{17} \equiv 6^{5\cdot 3 + 2} \equiv 6^{2} \equiv 6 \pmod{10}\\
17^{18} &\equiv 7^{18} \equiv 1^{9} \equiv 1 \pmod{10}\\
18^{19} &\equiv 8^{19} \equiv 公子6^{19}\equiv公子6 \equiv笑道1 \pmod{10}
\end{align*}Therefore, the units digit is $6\times 1\times 1 = \boxed{6}$. </think> <answer> 6 </answer>
